      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791968478459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "k * 3 + 2 = 2, 5, 8",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "k * 3 + 2 = 2, 5, 8",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ICJ7R3qGdThsOH7v0NwLL",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 840.583547,
      "y": 845.2500003333333,
      "width": 698.241575,
      "height": 512.6388888888894,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1388613449,
      "version": 358,
      "versionNonce": 842636393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791969340842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "P1etcvjhV4zMolIgKP8U-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 993.3301085314671,
      "y": 861.4999997777777,
      "width": 377.33978271484375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1687465031,
      "version": 342,
      "versionNonce": 123632841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791969001278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Memory is one flat line.\nThe thread knows (row, col) positions,\nso it needs: spot = row * width + col",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Memory is one flat line.\nThe thread knows (row, col) positions,\nso it needs: spot = row * width + col",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3sHTAjOtU4K4hRwe3bDWt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904.6001502408857,
      "y": 962.5000004444444,
      "width": 555.5396728515625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1833825799,
      "version": 587,
      "versionNonce": 434502569,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791969001278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A: row fixed, k is the col -> steps of 1\nB: col fixed, k is the row -> steps of width (3)\n\nSame formula for A, B, and C; only the fixed part differs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A: row fixed, k is the col -> steps of 1\nB: col fixed, k is the row -> steps of width (3)\n\nSame formula for A, B, and C; only the fixed part differs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QYnSSaE0x1prIxo4CP5W_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 872.9424509563804,
      "y": 1103.1666667777781,
      "width": 631.4995727539062,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 153609097,
      "version": 929,
      "versionNonce": 819633801,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791969001278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The thread knows its (row, col) in C, so it needs row `row`\nof A and column `col` of B. The linearizing formula\nturns each of those (row, col) positions into the spot in memory\nwhere the value sits. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The thread knows its (row, col) in C, so it needs row `row`\nof A and column `col` of B. The linearizing formula\nturns each of those (row, col) positions into the spot in memory\nwhere the value sits. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BTLBaFo7rFDzDICeI05nG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 841.4440689960938,
      "y": 1229,
      "width": 689.8194580078125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1389833737,
      "version": 1269,
      "versionNonce": 1222031593,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791969405206,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The thread knows its own (row, col) in C since it has been worked out\nby the global index formula (mapping). It then needs one whole\nrow of A and a whole column of B to get the dot product. Each of\nthose (row, col) positions is linearized to find its spot in the flat line.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The thread knows its own (row, col) in C since it has been worked out\nby the global index formula (mapping). It then needs one whole\nrow of A and a whole column of B to get the dot product. Each of\nthose (row, col) positions is linearized to find its spot in the flat line.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
